Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=14}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:56.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? The mayor's never\Nbeen gone for this long before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:57.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sounded like a battle\Nwas going on in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's been a lot more\Ncannon fire than usual, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll go to town to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You all just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:09.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are still pirates in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous of a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:15.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Exactly. That's why\Nyou'll need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of citizens are we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if we don't help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have got to find\Nout what's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us from going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:24.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We wanna do all we can to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:29.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}In all my life, I've never\Nbeen as mad at someone as him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:44.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard, Shanks, stole\Ncountless riches from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't know how you two are connected,\Nbut I can say whatever I want about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've earned that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:57.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The North Pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:58.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,South Pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:02:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, and I'm gonna keep on\Nsaying it because I'm right, clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:05.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:08.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bust you up flashily!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Counter attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:12.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:16.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody but you two cares which is\Ncolder, the North Pole or the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna know so badly, then why\Ndon't you go to both and find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now cool it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship to the north-northeast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Get ready! Time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes... I can't wait to plunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You seem happy, Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:34.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships are just like\Nbig floating treasure chests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:39.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for\Npirates to raid 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, there's some truth to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and everyone else\Nhere just don't have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the pirate's natural hunger and\Ndesire for plundering treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know what\Nit means to be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's... a... treasure map!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:07.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the treasure on the\Nbottom of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:20.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1936)}Now my life's path is\Nflashily decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.17,0:04:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna come\Ncelebrate with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We found a whole lot\Nof really neat stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no map!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:40.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... don't have... anything hidden...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:43.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:44.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna\Nleave this ship sometime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm gonna get my own ship, then gather\Na reliable crew and see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take my time. Heh...\NAll as a pirate, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:06.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of sentimental nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I do admire your\Nfighting skill, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you weren't such a softy,\NI'd make you one of my henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your henchman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have completely different\Noutlooks on life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:22.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I think we should just\Nfollow our own paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:23.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:27.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! You think you're such\Nan expert on pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But if we ever meet on the ocean,\Nand we'd have to have a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Pirates do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You never make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyways, you said something about\Nfinding some interesting loot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh yeah, We found a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:47.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard that the different fruits\Nare incarnations of the Sea Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, if you eat one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}you gain devil powers but the sea will\Nhate you and take your ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be stupid\Nto eat that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:06:01.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd never get that treasure on\Nthe ocean floor if I couldn't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet you could sell that fruit for\Nat least a hundred million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I, pirate apprentice Buggy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:15.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,am about to devour this Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gotta love the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never thinking of consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you feel any differently yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww, was it a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a real\NDevil Fruit before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! That worked flashily well!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys are so gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.97,0:06:47.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I was able to\Ntrick them so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, to jump ship before\Nthey find out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With the money I get from selling this\NDevil Fruit and finding the sunken treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll easily be able to form\Nmy own crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:59.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were you just saying something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:04.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be so jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't steal too much\Nfood from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna make the cook mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:10.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The captain told me to tell ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Damn you, Bastard!\N– Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why? Why? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Not my map!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:30.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:34.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,W... What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you lose\Nyour ability to swim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:41.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, What're you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:44.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:52.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Help... Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save you Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... are you telling me\Nthat Shanks saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, that's not the point\NI'm trying to get across!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because of what he did to\Nme I was unable to swim,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:15.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and therefore unable to\Nobtain my sunken treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, I had a revelation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:21.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If I couldn't go underwater, then I'd\Njust obtain all the treasure on dry land!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:24.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Using my brand new Chop-Chop Powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now I won't let {\i1}anyone{\i0}\Nwho touches my treasure live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:34.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Death to those who try to\Npilfer my hard earned treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here you beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it! He spotted me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:42.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance\Nof escaping from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.05,0:08:48.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm going to flashily chop you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:06.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My balls... My balls...\NThat was a cheap shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:09.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't run off yet, we're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better drop that treasure\Nand get outta here, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't want him\Ncoming after you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drop the money and go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:21.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why should I leave my treasure behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you just call it {\i1}your{\i0} treasure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right, you heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a thief who steals from pirates,\Nand I just stole a lot of treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:32.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from a really annoying one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that makes this my\Ntreasure now, Understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! That makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pure nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's {\i1}my{\i0} treasure and just\Nbecause you stole it from me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't make it yours,\Nyou dirty, sneaky thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:48.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly! What did your\Nparents teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A criminal trying to lecture\Nanother criminal? Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:53.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:54.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever, the day I take\Na morality lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from you, is the day\NI stop being a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready\Nfor the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:09.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Here comes, Chop, Chop...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try to save\Nyour friend from me now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it... He broke up\Ninto smaller pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give me back my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Coochie, coochi, coo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He,he...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See how you like... this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}you{\i0} knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving me my\Ntreasure back, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:04.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my treasure so get\Nyour grubby hands off it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:05.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give me back my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I already told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You haven't finished\Ndealing with {\i1}me{\i0} yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Consider that finishing move\Na little gift from the old mayor guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure! No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Oh yeah! The map!\N– My treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:59.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:11:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:03.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you flashily do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Assemble, Chop-Chop Parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looking for these, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gah! My parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! Way to go thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:30.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:32.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,110)}Now, Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That kid sure sent\NCaptain Buggy flyin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, What do we do\Nwithout the captain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep acting unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry your hat's all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can still put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I got Buggy out of here,\Nso I'm satisfied for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I have time, I'll fix\Nit for you, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I split this into two bags, so give\Nme a hand and carry half of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too heavy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sure is a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anything, that clown\NBuggy knew quality treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when he saw it, and now it's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet I can sell this for at\Nleast ten million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the chart to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You do want it don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:55.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Thanks, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I finally have it!\NA map of the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, does this also mean you'll\Nbe joining me and my pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you, no matter what,\NI'll never join a pirate crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hanging around with you\Nseems profitable enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just remember this, I'm only joining\Nyou... cause it's in my interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did we take care of everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And we got a Navigator and\Nwe got a chart of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about this.\NI feel light headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course you do. It's\Nalways something with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute. What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?\NYou're the worst of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:50.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's go help the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:51.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess we should wake the old\Nguy up, now that it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– You there!\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not residents of this village!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope. And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was all that cannon fire we heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:05.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sounded like there may\Nhave been a battle here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you know anything, please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh good, they're just citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought that maybe\Nthey were more pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:14.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:15.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:16.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:18.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pirates definitely did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:23.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one who\Nkicked that old man's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:27.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! You didn't have\Nto tell them that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:27.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.91,0:15:30.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should explain to them\Nso they don't get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Tell me, Why exactly did you knock our mayor\Nout and leave him in the street to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better explain yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Are you with the pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They're getting really bloodthirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let them know that\Nwe're thieves and pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:47.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just as we thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Idiot!\N– But it's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:56.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:15:59.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you ravage our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't show you\Nany mercy for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.57,0:16:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like they're\Nup for a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt our beloved mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you always make things worse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:24.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a good town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:25.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so mad, just\Nbecause of the old mayor guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:38.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something tells me they're not gonna\Nlisten to our side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're turning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!\NYou gotta let me know sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:43.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They ran into the alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:44.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:50.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doggie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:56.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Move, Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those three are pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're barking at the wrong people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he letting us pass through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Later, doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We only made it because of Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to put up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:29.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does it matter now?\NWe're done here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,\Yeah, Maybe so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is this your boat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:34.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special,\Nbut I guess it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:39.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I stole it from some dumb\Npirates a few days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a big mouth you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He! He!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We been waitin' for\Nya, ya little thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never thought you'd run into\Nus here, now didja, girlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:52.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:54.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, It's not just sort of!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're bound together by fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, these are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:18:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll have to punish\Nthe two of them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time you learned what happens\Nwhen you steal other people's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you. Ya' hear me?\NTime for your medicine. He. He.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:22.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! He's waking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... Thank goodness he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened here, Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:31.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was like this when we got here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:37.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There were a few pirates when we\Narrived, but they all ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are the young ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:46.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that? Are you talking\Nabout those three kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:50.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So they're... still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those fools. Treating a\Nsenior citizen like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:54.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We drove those pirates\Nout of town, Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:00.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to make them pay for\Nwhat they've done to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They deserve to be punished\Nfor destroying the peaceful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,town we all worked so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:11.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:12.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's still time to go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:13.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:15.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who's allowed\Nto complain about those kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone else\Nbad-mouth them! You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:24.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Why are you protecting\Nthose pirates, Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:27.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it! They think they can\Njust disappear and that's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... I think they were\Nrunning toward the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:33.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can't just leave like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:42.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of things I\Nwant to say to you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:48.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:52.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Buggy's mark on your sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well this did used to be Buggy's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think I should change it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:59.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Young ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the old mayor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:16.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die,\Nfilled with despair...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:36.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no words...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you do, Luffy?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you left that\Nbag of treasure back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:49.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bag was worth around\Nfive million berries, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:55.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's right. And they're gonna need that\Nmoney to repair their destroyed town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that was {\i1}my{\i0} treasure, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard\NI worked to steal it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the whole idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:08.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want it,\Njust go back and get it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't do that! {\i1}You{\i0} go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could die, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care! And if you do that again,\NI really will throw you in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:25.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, for better or worse, looks like\Nwe finally have a navigator in our crew.
